  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">介绍：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模组通过改进原有结构，增强了《我的世界》中的村庄，使其更具生机与探索乐趣。<br><br>「更好的村庄」优化了村庄的整体外观与布局，新增了多种房屋设计。模组旨在为玩家创造更沉浸、更真实的体验。<br><br>对于喜爱探索和与村庄互动的玩家来说，这款模组非常值得一试。它提供了全新的游戏玩法和挑战，为您的《我的世界》之旅增添更多变化。如果您想提升游戏体验，「更好的村庄」绝对是您不容错过的模组！</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gSdaxuLQ0Fw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">兼容性：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模组设计以确保最大兼容性。但部分模组可能需要专属的兼容数据包才能达到完美效果。总体而言，除少数意外问题或漏洞外，它应该能与大多数模组兼容。</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">完美兼容以下模组：</p><ul>\n<li>Repurposed Structures</li>\n<li>ChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village</li>\n<li>Bountiful（数据包可用，<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-bountiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>）</li>\n<li>Ice and Fire: Dragons（数据包可用，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-ice-and-fire-compat-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>）</li>\n<li>More Villagers（数据包可用，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-more-villagers-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>）</li>\n<li>Immersive Engineering（数据包可用，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>）</li>\n<li>Waystones</li>\n<li>以及更多...</li>\n</ul><p>注意：其他兼容性支持正在计划中，我们正积极开发。欢迎访问我们的 GitHub 提交兼容性请求（或加入我们的 Discord！）。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支持的模组加载器：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我们积极支持 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric 模组加载器，覆盖版本从 1.16.5 到最新版《我的世界》。点击下方链接选择您偏好的加载器：</p><div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[点我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[点我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">必需前置模组：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">请确保安装以下模组，它们对项目的正常运行及提供完整体验至关重要。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 📦 Library Ferret </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">链接：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">查找我们的资源并加入社区：</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 链接树 </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作伙伴：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本项目由 BisectHosting 自豪支持。查看他们的服务，轻松托管您的项目，享受高质量与可靠性。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 横幅\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行动号召：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有疑问？需要帮助？加入我们的 Discord 或访问 GitHub，与社区互动并贡献力量！</p>",
